图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"The ultimate 2-way bridge between OpenAI Codex and DSH: bidirectional chat sync, live Skills mount & auto MCP mirroring.","id":"gh:1335661102","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-codex-sync","slug":"Walvez/dsh-codex-sync","topics":["codex","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","import","mcp","model-context-protocol","openai-codex","sync"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"The ultimate 2-way bridge between OpenAI Codex and DSH: bidirectional chat sync, live Skills mount &"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" auto MCP mirroring."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# ⚡ dsh-codex-sync"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Two-way Codex↔DSH bridge: skills from `~/.codex/skills`, session import with workspace attach, liv"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"e MCP mirroring of `mcp_servers`, and a Codex-side reverse MCP installer.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*2-way project chat sync · Live Skills mount · Auto MCP mirroring · Native modern UI*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English •\n简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"🎛️ Native Sync Settings Modal"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"📍 Sidebar Workspace Trigger"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"📥 Import from Codex by Project"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"📤 Export DSH Chats to Codex"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 🤔 Why dsh-codex-sync?"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"When using OpenAI Codex, developers build up significant workflow assets:\n1. **Rich project chat his"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"tories** with complete code contexts, architecture decisions, and debugging steps;\n2. **Custom Skill"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"s libraries** under `~/.codex/skills` with tailored instructions and scripts;\n3. **Configured MCP to"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"olchains** for databases, web searches, and browser automation."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"When adopting or exploring **DeepSeek Harness (DSH)**, developers typically face major friction:\n- *"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"*Lost conversation history**: Incompatible session formats prevent resuming past Codex tasks in DSH;"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"\n- **Configuration duplication and drift**: Skills and MCP servers must be manually recreated and ma"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"intained in two separate tools;\n- **One-way dead ends**: Most migration scripts are one-time destruc"},{"id":"p12s5","text":"tive copies that offer no clean way to safely bring DSH continuations back to Codex."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**`dsh-codex-sync` eliminates this friction completely.** It is not a throwaway migrator, but a prod"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"uction-grade, continuous two-way bridge between Codex and DSH."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## ✨ Key Highlights"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 1. 💬 Two-Way Safe Project Chat Portability (Codex ⇄ DSH)\n- **Import from Codex**:\n- Browse conve"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rsations grouped by workspace folder in an intuitive project tree;\n- Preserves user prompts, assista"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"nt outputs, reasoning traces, and tool-call trajectories;\n- Automatically attaches imported sessions"},{"id":"p15s4","text":" to matching workspaces for **seamless continuation**;\n- Incremental re-import: Codex conversations "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"continued after the initial import are marked as `updated` and append only new turns without creatin"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"g duplicate sessions.\n- **Export to Codex**:\n- Export DSH native conversations or continuations back"},{"id":"p15s7","text":" into Codex;\n- Automatically matches Codex's workspace catalog, gracefully locking unknown directori"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"es to prevent orphan threads;\n- Creates clean, standalone Codex rollouts (`history_mode: legacy`) an"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"d SQLite index entries **without modifying or overwriting original Codex histories**;\n- View and con"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"tinue chats in Codex immediately after restarting the Codex app.\n- **Sub-Agent Thread Filtering**:\n-"},{"id":"p15s11","text":" Hides internal sub-agent threads by default to keep the conversation list focused;\n- Easily expand "},{"id":"p15s12","text":"and nest sub-agents under parent threads for selective, independent export."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 2. ⚡ Live First-Class Skills Mounting\n- Mounts `~/.codex/skills/*/SKILL.md` directly into DSH's "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"native skill catalog;\n- Full support for nested directory resources and multi-file skill bundles;\n- "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"**Zero-restart updates**: Edit a skill file on disk, and DSH recognizes the change on the next turn."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### 3. 🔌 Automated Bidirectional MCP Mirroring\n- **Codex → DSH**: Watches `~/.codex/config.toml` liv"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"e, dynamically mirroring `[mcp_servers.*]` to DSH with conflict avoidance and stderr silencing;\n- **"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"DSH → Codex (Reverse Bridge)**: Single-command setup (`npx dsh-codex-sync codex-install`) equips you"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"r Codex agent with tools to search, inspect, and install DSH plugins."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 4. 🎨 Native Modern UI Experience\n- **Adaptive Sidebar Trigger**: Sits right beside the workspace"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" header when expanded, and aligns below the search button when collapsed;\n- **Centered Modal Panel**"},{"id":"p18s3","text":": High-contrast, backdrop-blurred settings card with intuitive action cards, real-time switch feedba"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ck, and zero UI cutoff;\n- **Polished Design Integration**: Uses native DSH design tokens (`--dsw-ali"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"as-*`), pure CSS transitions with zero hover artifacts, and responsive text truncation."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 📦 Quick Start"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 1. Install in DSH"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Install via DSH Plugin Market (recommended):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Or configure inside your profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 2. Configure Codex Reverse MCP Bridge (Optional)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## 🎛️ Sync Settings & Toggles"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Click the **Codex Icon** in the sidebar to open the centered control modal:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Section | Item | Command / Config Key | Description |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| **Actions** | Import from Codex | `/import-all` | Open project picker to import chats into DSH |\n|"},{"id":"p30s2","text":" | Export to Codex | `/export-codex` | Export DSH chats into new Codex conversation copies |\n| | Rep"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"air sessions¹ | `/repair-sessions [--fix]` | Scan stored session logs for replay damage and heal the"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"m in place (see below) |\n| | Mirror status | `/mcp-status` | Modal overview of MCP servers, health, "},{"id":"p30s5","text":"and statuses |\n| | Refresh states | `/codex-settings` | Re-sync all switch states from the host |\n| "},{"id":"p30s6","text":"**Features** | Import commands | `enableImport` | Enable `/import-codex` slash command family |\n| | "},{"id":"p30s7","text":"Auto import | `autoImport` | Automatically import new Codex chats on startup |\n| | Instructions | `e"},{"id":"p30s8","text":"nableInstructions` | Inject `instructions.md` / `AGENTS.md` into prompt |\n| | Config summary | `enab"},{"id":"p30s9","text":"leConfig` | Inject `config.toml` model settings summary into prompt |\n| | Skills | `enableSkills` | "},{"id":"p30s10","text":"Register `~/.codex/skills` as live DSH skills |\n| | MCP mirror | `mcpMirror` | Auto-mirror `[mcp_ser"},{"id":"p30s11","text":"vers.*]` (applies immediately) |\n| **Language** | Language Switcher | `Language` | Toggle between 简体"},{"id":"p30s12","text":"ies immediately) |\n| **Language** | Language Switcher | `Language` | Toggle between 简体中文 / English |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"> ¹ A subtle hint at the bottom-left of the settings modal links imported-chat errors to this comman"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"¹ A subtle hint at the bottom-left of the settings modal links imported-chat errors to this command."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## 🩺 Troubleshooting: `token meter` / replay errors on imported chats"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"**Symptom** — switching the model or running compaction on an (imported) conversation fails with:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Why** — DSH's token meter validates the whole event log via cold replay when the model changes (pr"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"ovider usage anchors become invalid). Logs written before v1.6.0 lacked paired `step/start…step/end`"},{"id":"p35s3","text":" markers, and mixed logs can carry stale seq citations — both fail loud only during that replay."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

